        <gr str="1113">Belshazzar </gr>
        <gr str="7690">greatly </gr>
        <gr str="927">troubled</gr>, and his <gr str="2122">countenance </gr>was <gr str="8133">changed </gr>in <gr str="5922">him</gr>, and his <gr str="7261">lords </gr>were <gr str="7672">confused</gr>. <DIV>
