      </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="10">
        <STYLE css="font-style:italic">Now</STYLE> the <gr str="4433">queen</gr>, by <gr str="6903">reason </gr>of the <gr str="4406">words </gr>of the <gr str="4430">king </gr>and his <gr str="7261">lords</gr>, <gr str="5954">came </gr>into the <gr str="4961">banquet </gr>
