        <gr str="6032">spoke </gr>and <gr str="560">said</gr>, O <gr str="4430">king</gr>, <gr str="2418">live </gr>for <gr str="5957">ever</gr>: let <gr str="409">not </gr>thy <gr str="7476">thoughts </gr>
        <gr str="927">trouble </gr>thee, nor let thy <gr str="2122">countenance </gr>be <gr str="8133">changed</gr>:</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="11">There <gr str="383">is </gr>a <gr str="1400">man </gr>in thy <gr str="4437">kingdom</gr>, in whom <STYLE css="font-style:italic">is</STYLE> the <gr str="7308">spirit </gr>of the <gr str="6922">holy </gr>
