        <gr str="5094">light </gr>and <gr str="7924">understanding </gr>and <gr str="2452">wisdom</gr>, like the <gr str="2452">wisdom </gr>of the <gr str="426">gods</gr>, was <gr str="7912">found </gr>in him; whom the <gr str="4430">king </gr>
        <gr str="5020">Nebuchadnezzar </gr>thy <gr str="2">father</gr>, the <gr str="4430">king</gr>, <STYLE css="font-style:italic">I say</STYLE>, thy <gr str="2">father</gr>, <gr str="6966">made </gr>
        <gr str="7229">master </gr>of the <gr str="2749">magicians</gr>, <gr str="826">astrologers</gr>, <gr str="3779">Chaldeans</gr>, <STYLE css="font-style:italic">and </STYLE>
        <gr str="1505">soothsayers</gr>; <DIV>
          <NOTE type="x-studynote">father: or, grandfather</NOTE>
        </DIV>
      </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="12">Forasmuch <gr str="6903 3606">as </gr>an <gr str="3493">excellent </gr>
        <gr str="7308">spirit</gr>, and <gr str="4486">knowledge</gr>, and <gr str="7924">understanding</gr>, the <gr str="6590">interpreting </gr>of <gr str="2493">dreams</gr>, and <gr str="263">declaring </gr>of hard <gr str="280">sentences</gr>, and <gr str="8271">dissolving </gr>of <gr str="7001">doubts</gr>, were <gr str="7912">found </gr>in the same <gr str="1841">Daniel</gr>, whom the <gr str="4430">king </gr>
        <gr str="7761 8036">named </gr>
        <gr str="1096">Belteshazzar</gr>: <gr str="3705">now </gr>let <gr str="1841">Daniel </gr>be <gr str="7123">called</gr>, and he will <gr str="2324">show </gr>the <gr str="6591">interpretation</gr>. <DIV>
