        <gr str="2452">wisdom </gr>is <gr str="7912">found </gr>in thee.</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="15">And <gr str="3705">now </gr>the <gr str="2445">wise </gr>
        <STYLE css="font-style:italic">men</STYLE>, the <gr str="826">astrologers</gr>, have been <gr str="5954">brought </gr>in <gr str="6925">before </gr>me, that they should <gr str="7123">read </gr>
        <gr str="1836">this </gr>
