        <gr str="3809">not </gr>
        <gr str="2324">show </gr>the <gr str="6591">interpretation </gr>of the <gr str="4406">thing</gr>:</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="16">And <gr str="576">I </gr>have <gr str="8086">heard </gr>of <gr str="5922">thee</gr>, that thou <gr str="3202">canst </gr>
