        <gr str="7001">doubts</gr>: <gr str="3705">now </gr>
        <gr str="2006">if </gr>thou <gr str="3202">canst </gr>
        <gr str="7123">read </gr>the <gr str="3792">writing</gr>, and make <gr str="3046">known </gr>to me the <gr str="6591">interpretation </gr>of it, thou shalt be <gr str="3848">clothed </gr>with <gr str="711">scarlet</gr>, and <STYLE css="font-style:italic">have</STYLE> a <gr str="2002">chain </gr>of <gr str="1722">gold </gr>
        <gr str="5922">about </gr>thy <gr str="6676">neck</gr>, and shalt be the <gr str="8531">third </gr>
        <gr str="7981">ruler </gr>in the <gr str="4437">kingdom</gr>. <DIV>
