        <gr str="3764">throne</gr>, and they <gr str="5709">took </gr>his <gr str="3367">glory </gr>from <gr str="4481">him</gr>: <DIV>
          <NOTE type="x-studynote">in pride: or, to deal proudly</NOTE>
