          <NOTE type="x-studynote">his heart…: or, he made his heart equal, etc</NOTE>
        </DIV>
      </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="22">And <gr str="607">thou </gr>his <gr str="1247">son</gr>, O <gr str="1113">Belshazzar</gr>, hast <gr str="3809">not </gr>
