        <gr str="7990">ruler </gr>in the <gr str="4437">kingdom</gr>.</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="30">In that <gr str="3916">night </gr>was <gr str="1113">Belshazzar </gr>the <gr str="4430">king </gr>of the <gr str="3779">Chaldeans </gr>
        <gr str="6992">slain</gr>.</VERS>
